Comment GitHub will post
    AI-generated review comment — tool: appr-ai-sal, agent: security

    configureDemoEnv calls os.Setenv on APPR_AI_SAL_CONFIG_DIR and APPR_AI_SAL_CACHE_DIR without restoring
    them on exit. If the demo binary is exec'd from a host process (e.g. an integration test harness)
    those env vars leak into the parent's children. Recommend redirecting only inside the demo process via
    package-level overrides instead of the global env.

      if err := os.Setenv("APPR_AI_SAL_CONFIG_DIR", cfgDir); err != nil {
          return err
      }
      defer os.Unsetenv("APPR_AI_SAL_CONFIG_DIR")

